                                "sense_id": "7c9e6dd6-e91a-39a3-a3ac-918496d574d0",
                                "text": "A couple of oil shocks, a Chernobyl meltdown, and a Gulf War later, his basic message - the need to emphasize efficiency and renewable resources over oil and nuclear power - is still a minority view,[…]",
                                "translation": "在经历了几次石油危机、一次切尔诺贝利核电站事故和一次海湾战争之后，他的基本观点——需要强调效率和可再生资源而不是石油和核能——相信的人依然不多， […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "de45cd13-e7fe-393b-bf15-0a8814590540",
                        "entry_id": "6be2c2b7-ebbd-3945-87bf-75a9d9fb712a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "切尔诺贝利核事故"
