                                "sense_id": "de45cd13-e7fe-393b-bf15-0a8814590540",
                                "text": "After Chernobyl, very few nuclear power plants were built for years.",
                                "translation": "切尔诺贝利事故发生后，多年来，核电站建得很少。"
                            }
                        ]
